# Kazuha Xianyun Citlali Bennett. KQMS, pretty optimised. ~23 second rotation. 3 skill plunges and 5 xianyun plunges; wait 0.75 seconds between each plunge to melt all except the last skill plunge. Timing isn't too strict, just make sure there is a cryo aura before plunging. 100% collisions on skill, 50% on regular plunges. No burst kazuha

# Options listed by dps
